Windows boundary

The parser and source-coherence behavior execute in native unit tests on macOS. PowerShell/WMI counter availability still requires a real Windows run; no native Windows success is claimed. Microsoft also documents inaccuracies in GPU process-memory counters, so source coherence is enforced even when a counter is available.
